      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Cambridge’s glass legacy lives on with former Cambridge Glass, Boyd Glass, and Mosser Glass plants that once made the town famous among collectors.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
